WEBVTT

00:09.676 --> 00:10.927
Dude, it's him.

00:11.011 --> 00:13.847
- Do you think it's actually true?
- Yeah right, stop bullshitting.

00:13.930 --> 00:14.806
I'm gonna ask him.

00:17.600 --> 00:18.685
Is the rumor, real?

00:20.020 --> 00:20.645
Rumor?

00:21.146 --> 00:23.815
We heard that Ahn Su-ho,
Yeon Si-eun, and you caught some gansters.

00:23.898 --> 00:24.816
The Free Money guy.

00:27.610 --> 00:28.903
Uh, uh-huh.

00:29.487 --> 00:31.156
- Are you freaking serious?
- Oh, woah.

00:31.239 --> 00:33.491
Yeah my friend lost millions
of won from that app.

00:33.575 --> 00:35.577
So what happened? Tell us everything.

00:35.660 --> 00:39.581
- Hey, Beom-seok-a, gimme your IG.
- You gotta tell us man, I'm dying to know.

00:49.716 --> 00:51.051
Did you get home okay?

00:52.635 --> 00:53.219
Yeah,

00:53.720 --> 00:54.637
I did.

00:55.430 --> 00:57.599
- You?
- I heard that Su-ho and Beom-seok got

00:57.682 --> 01:01.102
- kidnapped, and Si-eun brought the police.
- I got home alright, too.

01:03.480 --> 01:04.731
They're so freaking cool.

01:17.160 --> 01:17.827
Alright.

01:34.677 --> 01:35.929
You're gonna eat all that?

01:36.012 --> 01:37.680
Yeah and then I'm going to the snack bar.

01:37.764 --> 01:39.516
- Right, Oh Beom?
- Mhm.

01:39.599 --> 01:41.601
- My treat, you should come.
- Nah, you always do.

01:41.684 --> 01:43.645
Today it's my treat, get what you want.

01:43.728 --> 01:45.647
It's going to be killer. Get ready.

01:47.148 --> 01:48.733
Are you guys free this weekend?

01:49.317 --> 01:50.735
I found this awesome restaurant.

01:50.819 --> 01:51.861
Let's go.

01:51.945 --> 01:52.904
Sounds like something I'd like.

01:52.987 --> 01:53.613
I'm in.

01:54.114 --> 01:55.031
Let's go.

01:57.325 --> 01:59.452
Um, why talk about food
when you're eating?

02:02.872 --> 02:04.457
What about you? You talk about life

02:04.958 --> 02:06.543
while you're still living it.

02:12.257 --> 02:12.841
Oh,

02:13.341 --> 02:14.384
what about Yeong-i's job?

02:14.467 --> 02:16.052
Her interview's this weekend.

02:17.095 --> 02:18.930
We're short staffed so it works out.

02:20.473 --> 02:22.058
- Who's Yeong-i?
- That girl.

02:22.142 --> 02:23.059
The

02:23.560 --> 02:25.436
one who bashed Gil-su on the head.

02:27.147 --> 02:27.981
Oh.

02:28.565 --> 02:30.108
Were you both already friends?

02:30.191 --> 02:31.025
No.

02:34.237 --> 02:34.863
Ah,

02:35.363 --> 02:36.823
she's staying at Su-ho's
place for a while.

02:36.906 --> 02:38.575
Should we invite her this weekend?

02:42.203 --> 02:44.372
Sure,
that's fine with me. Yeah, invite her.

03:19.782 --> 03:20.909
AHN SU-HO

03:23.828 --> 03:26.164
AHN SU-HO
FOLLOWING

03:36.257 --> 03:37.133
YEONG-I

03:42.013 --> 03:44.599
CHILLING AT HAN RIVER

03:54.776 --> 03:56.486
DINNER WITH SU-HO'S GRANDMA

04:01.741 --> 04:04.285
SI-EUN SURPRISED US WITH TASTY HAMBURGERS!

04:29.894 --> 04:30.728
How is he?

04:33.523 --> 04:34.357
Dad's

04:34.607 --> 04:35.483
been busy.

04:35.566 --> 04:36.567
The season.

04:40.363 --> 04:41.656
Have you decided your path?

04:45.493 --> 04:46.494
Not yet.

04:47.120 --> 04:49.163
It's alright to take time to decide.

04:50.123 --> 04:51.916
I'm not worried about your career path.

04:52.500 --> 04:54.127
You're always good at everything.

04:57.714 --> 04:59.257
There's a lot I can't do.

05:01.259 --> 05:02.093
Hm?

05:08.182 --> 05:08.891
Nothing.

05:15.106 --> 05:15.690
Hey,

05:16.190 --> 05:16.983
almost finished?

05:17.483 --> 05:18.860
We can get coffee on our way.

05:18.943 --> 05:19.902
I have a meeting.

05:24.490 --> 05:25.325
Hello?

05:26.326 --> 05:27.243
I'm on my way.

05:28.494 --> 05:30.038
What do you wanna do on your birthday?

05:30.538 --> 05:31.664
What do you think?

05:32.165 --> 05:33.333
Nothing special.

05:33.416 --> 05:35.251
We can meet up, have something to eat,

05:35.335 --> 05:36.336
- Well, I could-
- yeah?

05:36.419 --> 05:37.462
Watch it.

05:37.545 --> 05:38.588
We can't just do nothing on your birthday.

05:38.671 --> 05:40.006
We gotta have a lot of fun.

05:40.089 --> 05:42.425
Ugh, we don't have to, ajumma-ya.

05:43.259 --> 05:44.260
Oh when's your birthday?

05:45.136 --> 05:46.512
Saturday two weeks from now.

05:47.347 --> 05:48.222
Rent a party room?

05:48.848 --> 05:49.724
Ajumma.

05:50.600 --> 05:51.601
Aren't you saving money?

05:51.684 --> 05:52.352
Huh?

05:52.852 --> 05:54.812
I thought you were trying to rent a room.

05:58.816 --> 06:01.277
- Yeah, that's our order.
- Agh, the menu's stacked.

06:01.361 --> 06:02.153
What should I get?

06:04.155 --> 06:05.156
What would you like?

06:06.449 --> 06:07.575
Iced Americano for me.

06:08.117 --> 06:08.743
I want

06:09.243 --> 06:10.536
an iced Vienna.

06:13.247 --> 06:13.956
Let's get a table.

06:15.958 --> 06:17.418
This one looks good, right?

06:20.046 --> 06:21.089
Come sit over here.

06:22.965 --> 06:24.133
Would you like to order?

06:24.967 --> 06:26.344
Hey, give me a thousand won.

06:26.427 --> 06:27.387
- Don't have it.
- Yes please.

06:27.470 --> 06:28.304
Here.

06:43.986 --> 06:44.904
Hey, Si-eun-a!

06:47.824 --> 06:49.200
Hey, hurry and come sit.

06:50.118 --> 06:51.953
What? Why are you so dressed up today?

06:52.036 --> 06:53.788
Did you think I'd be into that?

06:54.288 --> 06:56.416
- You're so smart.
- Where have you been?

06:56.999 --> 06:58.876
Hmm? You don't need to know.

06:58.960 --> 07:00.461
I just had a thing.

07:01.170 --> 07:02.755
A thing? What thing?

07:03.381 --> 07:04.215
Hey,

07:04.715 --> 07:07.927
- he's a super sus kinda guy.
- I already know where Si-eun's been.

07:09.804 --> 07:11.264
Stop keeping track of me.

07:11.347 --> 07:13.558
No way.
I have to watch to see when you get home.

07:13.641 --> 07:14.809
Good idea. Check in on him.

07:15.309 --> 07:17.353
- Do you know what WithMap is?
- No idea.

07:18.813 --> 07:19.689
Hey, Oh Beom.

07:19.772 --> 07:20.606
Hey.

07:43.796 --> 07:46.007
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 1

09:13.511 --> 09:15.471
- Want a drink?
- Hm?

09:16.013 --> 09:17.139
- Want a drink?
- Sure,

09:17.723 --> 09:18.641
should I come?

09:18.724 --> 09:19.809
No, I'll go by myself.

09:49.213 --> 09:50.214
Dang it.

09:50.798 --> 09:51.215
Hey!

09:51.716 --> 09:52.925
Oh Beom-seok.

09:53.009 --> 09:53.884
- Oh Beom-seok?
- Hey!

09:54.552 --> 09:56.178
Beom-seok? Why would he be here?

09:56.262 --> 09:57.305
- Stop lying.
- It was him.

09:57.388 --> 09:58.556
Stop shitting me. Don't lie.

09:58.639 --> 10:00.182
- I really saw him.
- Hey, Beom-seok-a.

10:00.266 --> 10:00.891
Shoot.

10:01.392 --> 10:02.268
- Did he see us and run off?
- Beom-seok-jjang.

10:02.351 --> 10:03.352
Beom-seok-a, where are you?

10:03.436 --> 10:04.437
Beom-seok sings too?

10:05.021 --> 10:05.813
Oh Beom-seok!

10:05.896 --> 10:06.897
Hey, call his phone.

10:10.443 --> 10:11.235
Shit.

10:30.838 --> 10:32.131
Yeah, we're at karaoke.

10:33.591 --> 10:34.550
The room number?

10:35.343 --> 10:36.177
Dunno.

10:38.179 --> 10:39.972
Hey, your friends keep calling you.

10:43.351 --> 10:45.102
You stupid bitch, what the hell, huh?!

10:45.686 --> 10:48.147
Why did you pick up my phone
without asking? Fuck.

10:49.649 --> 10:51.108
Hey man, what's wrong?

10:51.942 --> 10:53.444
Are you gonna hit me, or what?

10:54.779 --> 10:56.739
- Fuck you.
- I will seriously fucking kill you.

10:56.822 --> 10:57.782
Hey, that's enough.

10:57.865 --> 10:59.283
What's with you, man?

11:01.827 --> 11:03.245
- Beom-seok-a.
- You dumb fuck.

11:05.790 --> 11:06.832
I said that's enough.

11:13.464 --> 11:15.633
Fuck this, you stupid crazy asshole.

11:16.425 --> 11:17.510
Fuck off.

11:18.344 --> 11:18.928
Hey.

11:19.428 --> 11:20.388
Hey!

11:21.847 --> 11:22.765
I'll go after her.

11:26.102 --> 11:27.103
Where are you going?

11:31.899 --> 11:32.733
Are you okay?

11:37.738 --> 11:38.572
Yeah.

11:39.365 --> 11:40.199
Fine.

11:41.992 --> 11:42.952
Hey, Beom-seok-a.

11:43.035 --> 11:45.329
- I told you that I saw him!
- Wow, my Beom-seok-jjang!

11:45.413 --> 11:46.455
Fuck, you were right.

11:47.915 --> 11:49.500
How've you been, Beom-seok-a?

11:50.543 --> 11:52.837
- It's really been a while.
- Damn, man.

11:52.920 --> 11:54.130
We missed you, dude.

11:55.089 --> 11:56.549
We missed you, man.

11:57.675 --> 11:58.426
What?

11:59.635 --> 12:00.928
We're Beom-seok's friends.

12:04.181 --> 12:05.307
We were talking.

12:06.726 --> 12:07.935
It's just been so long,

12:08.018 --> 12:09.103
we want to talk too.

12:11.147 --> 12:12.398
Then do it later.

12:18.738 --> 12:19.655
Sorry about that.

12:20.823 --> 12:21.782
Let's hang soon.

12:21.866 --> 12:22.867
I'll call you.

12:23.993 --> 12:25.453
Make sure you pick up.

12:27.496 --> 12:28.372
Let's go.

12:28.456 --> 12:29.498
- See ya.
- See you later.

12:29.582 --> 12:30.416
Man.

12:31.041 --> 12:33.461
- Would've been fun.
- He still looks like a loser.

12:35.963 --> 12:36.881
What was that?

12:38.799 --> 12:39.383
Huh?

12:39.884 --> 12:40.718
Those guys.

12:43.179 --> 12:44.013
Oh.

12:45.806 --> 12:46.932
It's no big deal.

12:52.813 --> 12:53.731
Come on.

12:55.024 --> 12:56.025
Oh, man.

12:58.986 --> 13:00.613
His tongue's moving so fast

13:00.696 --> 13:02.573
but he sounds like a freaking dumbass.

13:03.199 --> 13:05.785
- You should do that all day.
- All day, every day.

13:06.702 --> 13:07.536
Hey.

13:09.997 --> 13:11.624
- Do it again, one more time.
- Dude, you're killing me.

13:11.707 --> 13:12.541
Hey!

13:18.798 --> 13:19.340
Quiet.

13:20.591 --> 13:21.717
What's his problem?

13:22.426 --> 13:24.345
- I was just trying to be funny.
- You were really funny.

13:24.428 --> 13:25.679
Shut your mouths.

13:34.188 --> 13:34.939
Did you laugh?

13:36.398 --> 13:37.233
I didn't laugh.

13:38.484 --> 13:39.944
I heard you laughing.

13:40.444 --> 13:41.570
Do you want to die,

13:41.654 --> 13:42.571
you fucking prick?

13:44.198 --> 13:44.949
Hey, Beom-seok.

13:46.033 --> 13:46.951
What's wrong?

13:49.954 --> 13:52.456
Dude's being a dick 'cause Ahn Su-ho
and Yeon Si-eun are on his side.

13:52.540 --> 13:53.374
What?

13:55.042 --> 13:55.668
Hey, move.

13:56.168 --> 13:57.044
What is it?

13:57.127 --> 13:58.087
What's going on?

13:58.170 --> 13:59.088
Hm?

13:59.588 --> 14:00.631
- He flipped out for like no reason.
- Fuck you.

14:00.714 --> 14:02.883
- I'm going to kill you, asshole.
- Hey, that's enough.

14:02.967 --> 14:04.176
Enough. Hey.

14:04.677 --> 14:05.761
What the fuck are you looking at?

14:05.845 --> 14:06.804
- Huh, huh?
- Why do you keep trying to

14:06.887 --> 14:07.930
be so tough? It's kinda cute.

14:08.013 --> 14:10.182
Si-eun-a. Cafeteria. Food.

14:12.560 --> 14:14.311
Stop putting your arm around me.

14:16.605 --> 14:17.439
Huh?

14:27.533 --> 14:28.701
What's gotten into him?

14:50.848 --> 14:51.849
FUCKER 3

14:55.769 --> 14:56.687
15 MISSED CALLS

14:56.770 --> 14:58.105
16 MISSED CALLS

14:58.188 --> 14:59.189
FUCKER 4

15:12.828 --> 15:14.705
17 MISSED CALLS

15:51.200 --> 15:52.076
How was it?

15:52.159 --> 15:54.620
Feeling refreshed from your
early morning workout?

15:58.040 --> 15:59.750
Did you get in touch with Oh Beom?

16:03.379 --> 16:04.088
No.

16:04.588 --> 16:06.507
Is there something going on with him?

16:06.590 --> 16:08.008
He won't pick up his phone.

16:08.717 --> 16:09.551
Wanna

16:10.511 --> 16:12.012
swing by his place later?

16:12.930 --> 16:14.431
Yeah, let's go see him.

16:16.141 --> 16:17.059
All right.

16:17.142 --> 16:18.268
Stand up.

16:19.144 --> 16:20.270
You told me to just run.

16:20.771 --> 16:23.148
- There's more?
- I said I'd give you a lesson.

16:23.232 --> 16:24.191
Mm.

16:24.608 --> 16:25.567
We'll do just the basics.

16:28.821 --> 16:30.781
Stand with your feet shoulder width apart.

16:31.448 --> 16:33.409
The tip of your feet point diagonally.

16:34.243 --> 16:35.202
You can stop anytime.

16:35.285 --> 16:36.203
You have to be tired.

16:36.286 --> 16:37.079
Go home and sleep.

16:37.579 --> 16:38.706
I'm not tired, don't worry.

16:38.789 --> 16:39.707
Come on.

16:44.003 --> 16:44.962
Make sure you always

16:45.045 --> 16:46.046
tuck in your chin.

16:46.130 --> 16:46.964
Okay?

16:47.548 --> 16:48.716
Arms like this.

16:49.591 --> 16:51.927
You have to use your arms to protect
your chin. At all times.

16:52.011 --> 16:52.594
Don't forget.

16:53.721 --> 16:54.555
Chin.

16:55.097 --> 16:56.015
That's it.

16:56.640 --> 16:57.224
Next, imagine

16:57.808 --> 16:58.934
there's a punk in front of you.

16:59.018 --> 17:02.062
He's threatening to beat you to death,
you're not gonna live, etcetera.

17:02.146 --> 17:04.940
When this happens,
you don't want to look into his eyes.

17:05.024 --> 17:06.233
Look at his shoulders, instead.

17:08.193 --> 17:08.861
Watch me.

17:11.947 --> 17:13.323
Keep your eyes on his shoulders.

17:13.824 --> 17:16.243
Then,
when his shoulder comes toward your face,

17:16.326 --> 17:19.288
duck below at a ninety-degree angle.
And then grab!

17:19.872 --> 17:22.291
In this pose,
grab his knees and push him over.

17:22.374 --> 17:23.208
One, two, three.

17:26.128 --> 17:27.504
That's called a takedown.

17:28.756 --> 17:31.133
The next step is to take
your fists and beat-

17:33.343 --> 17:33.927
Nevermind.

17:34.428 --> 17:35.387
Run.

17:36.180 --> 17:37.347
It's better just to run.

17:39.975 --> 17:41.727
Run away while the other guy's down.

17:43.228 --> 17:45.230
Because you might get hurt fighting him.

17:48.776 --> 17:49.568
Got it?

17:59.036 --> 17:59.787
This is it?

18:00.287 --> 18:01.872
He lives in a freaking nice place.

18:07.544 --> 18:08.796
What are you guys doing here?

18:12.132 --> 18:14.009
Dude, why did you turn your phone off?

18:15.344 --> 18:16.553
Oh, I didn't know it was off.

18:17.054 --> 18:18.222
Come in.

18:19.306 --> 18:20.140
What about school?

18:20.224 --> 18:21.225
Huh?

18:21.308 --> 18:22.351
Why'd you no show?

18:22.434 --> 18:23.268
Hmm?

18:24.144 --> 18:25.395
Your place is sick.

18:26.230 --> 18:27.689
I wasn't feeling well.

18:28.357 --> 18:30.067
- Put those on.
- Nice.

18:30.150 --> 18:33.278
This is probably why you're so thin.
Lose weight just walking

18:33.362 --> 18:34.321
around your house.

18:35.572 --> 18:36.615
This place is huge.

18:38.200 --> 18:40.327
Is this the famous ZZ
plant that's supposed

18:40.410 --> 18:42.329
to bring in a lot of money and wealth?

18:43.747 --> 18:44.331
Hm?

18:44.832 --> 18:45.833
This is amazing.

18:46.416 --> 18:47.501
This room's gigantic.

18:47.584 --> 18:48.544
Bigger than my house.

18:49.044 --> 18:50.295
Do you feel really ill?

18:52.214 --> 18:53.757
No, not too bad.

18:53.841 --> 18:54.925
Just some.

18:55.008 --> 18:57.386
Hey, your mother's really beautiful.

18:57.886 --> 18:59.930
It's great seeing your family so happy.

19:00.597 --> 19:01.390
You all look alike.

19:01.890 --> 19:02.641
Hm.

19:03.142 --> 19:04.351
We aren't family.

19:08.397 --> 19:11.483
My father adopted me publicly
when he got into politics.

19:11.567 --> 19:13.277
It was a publicity stunt.

19:19.825 --> 19:20.909
You guys want a drink?

19:30.419 --> 19:31.545
Is something wrong?

19:33.630 --> 19:35.215
- No, nothing's wrong.
- Hey,

19:35.716 --> 19:36.717
what is it?

19:36.800 --> 19:37.509
Hmm?

19:38.010 --> 19:39.052
It's okay.

19:39.136 --> 19:40.429
You can tell me anything.

19:42.139 --> 19:42.931
Maybe

19:44.808 --> 19:47.394
is it because of those guys at karaoke?

19:49.438 --> 19:50.063
Is it them?

19:50.564 --> 19:51.440
Karaoke?

19:52.024 --> 19:52.900
What karaoke?

20:04.369 --> 20:05.329
Stay right there.

20:07.831 --> 20:08.999
Hey, move over.

20:10.918 --> 20:11.919
At ease.

20:13.170 --> 20:16.381
- I said stand at ease, you freaking mutt.
- Hurry the hell up.

20:17.466 --> 20:18.342
Did you forget?

20:18.425 --> 20:20.510
- I told you to stand right.
- Here I come.

20:20.594 --> 20:22.888
- Give it everything you got, okay?
- Show him what you've got, give it to him!

20:22.971 --> 20:23.680
- Pow!
- Nice job!

20:23.764 --> 20:24.681
Yes, that's it!

20:26.516 --> 20:27.643
- Are you crying?
- This plebe.

20:27.726 --> 20:28.560
- Fuck you.
- Are you crying?

20:28.644 --> 20:30.062
- Stop pretending like it hurts.
- Hey, hey.

20:30.145 --> 20:30.854
Beom-seok-a,

20:31.438 --> 20:32.564
you better not tell your dad.

20:32.648 --> 20:33.190
'Kay?

20:33.774 --> 20:34.441
Hey, let's go.

20:34.942 --> 20:36.526
It's no fucking fun beating him up.

20:36.610 --> 20:38.946
I'm starving. Let's go get some food.

20:39.029 --> 20:41.323
- Yeah, I'm hungry too.
- Ugh, that was so boring.

20:41.406 --> 20:42.824
Total waste of time.

20:43.533 --> 20:44.826
At my former school,

20:46.870 --> 20:48.163
I was bullied.

20:49.665 --> 20:50.999
And because of them,

20:52.626 --> 20:54.211
I ended up in the hospital

20:55.087 --> 20:56.755
and transferred schools to here.

20:58.882 --> 21:01.510
But then ever since they
ran into me at karaoke.

21:01.593 --> 21:03.136
They won't stop calling,

21:03.637 --> 21:05.055
telling me to come out.

21:07.474 --> 21:08.350
Oh, fuck.

21:09.518 --> 21:11.687
Why'd those fucking assholes
do that to you?

21:12.271 --> 21:13.021
Huh?

21:13.814 --> 21:15.148
What did you even do wrong?

21:15.732 --> 21:17.359
Sometimes it just happens.

21:17.901 --> 21:20.195
In order to move up in
their group of friends,

21:20.862 --> 21:22.322
they pick someone to bully.

21:22.906 --> 21:25.701
What did I do wrong?
I didn't do anything to provoke it.

21:27.661 --> 21:28.996
It's okay, Beom-seok-a.

21:32.124 --> 21:33.792
It wasn't your fault.

21:41.466 --> 21:43.010
Call those dickheads right now.

